# Wiki

The plain-language wiki is https://github.com/guzino/absence-critic/wiki. It is a separate git repo (`absence-critic.wiki`, branch `master`). It is not a folder here, and it is not `docs/`.

When a change would make Home, How it works, Try it, Words, or What comes next false, update that page in the same piece of work. Follow `.cursor/skills/update-wiki/SKILL.md`. Match `.cursor/skills/update-wiki/design.md`.

Do not restyle the wiki. Do not copy origin `docs/` into it. Do not invent findings. The code change still lands as a pull request. The wiki push is to that wiki repo's `master`, with no force-push.
